            "id": "opening",
            "completionFact": "cinematic_opening_complete",
            "dialogueId": "prologue_opening",
            "subtitleCues": [
                "00:00 See those lights?",
                "00:05 That's a water tower.",
                "00:10 Tonight, it's north.",
                "00:15 What's there?",
                "00:20 Whatever isn't here.",
                "00:25 Do they have better fries?",
                "00:30 Statistically, probably.",
                "00:35 Then it's settled. We save up, fix a car, and we all go.",
                "00:40 All of us?",
                "00:45 All of us."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "maya",
            "completionFact": "cinematic_maya_complete",
            "dialogueId": "highlight_maya",
            "subtitleCues": [
                "00:00 The room is nearly empty, which is somehow worse and better.",
                "00:05 You looked at it anyway. That counts.",
                "00:10 Maya stands beneath the gallery lights and lets the silence belong to the paintings.",
                "00:15 A child points at the shuttered market on one canvas.",
                "00:20 Maya hands Jamie the studio key without claiming she will use it.",
